      "text": "**Air quality doesn’t look too bad for a jog** in Penang: the latest reading I found for **6:11 pm on October 17** was around **AQI 51–80 (Moderate)** across the listed areas. ([iqair.com](https://www.iqair.com/au/air-quality/malaysia/penang))\n\nIf you’re generally healthy, an easy or moderate jog should be okay. If you have asthma or heart/lung issues, or you notice haze or irritation, take it easy or jog indoors; “Moderate” air can affect unusually sensitive people, especially with prolonged or strenuous exercise. ([epa.gov](https://www.epa.gov/ozone-pollution-and-your-patients-health/patient-exposure-and-air-quality-index?utm_source=openai)) Readings vary by neighborhood and may have changed since that update.",
